This is a WASM-based MobiClip Player written in Rust, which supports .mo, .mods and .moflex files.

- player.html - The Player
- mobiclip_wasm/ - The WASM Rust Decoder
- pkg/ - A compiled version of the WASM Rust Decoder
- index.html - A site embedding the player

This code is licensed under the GNU GENERAL PUBLIC LICENSE v3

How to build: Install Rust and the dependencies and run "cd mobiclip_wasm && bash build.sh"

How to use: Open https://mobiclip.revivemii.xyz in your Webbrowser

